(7224242, 1115550, 30861, '<td valign="top">Such a sad look! And a blind bear! I guess it''s hard to depict "deaf", jejeje. Thanks so much for the kind wishes, Linda. Also, that''s a wonderful font you''ve used. Remind me to fihgure out how to acquire it, once I''m back home :-)</td>', 'Such a sad look! And a blind bear! I guess it''s hard to depict "deaf", jejeje. Thanks so much for the kind wishes, Linda. Also, that''s a wonderful font you''ve used. Remind me to fihgure out how to acquire it, once I''m back home :-)', '2014-06-04 01:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
