(7226736, 1115521, 117474, '<td valign="top">This is "simple"? <br/>It''s excellent! Well done on such s good replica.</td>', 'This is "simple"? It''s excellent! Well done on such s good replica.', '2014-06-11 03:48:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(7226742, 1115542, 163430, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jules1x:</b></div><hr/><i> ahhh.  What a sweet bear.  Nicely lit. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you. I was going for cute :-)<br/> <br/>The lighting was more or less classic portrait:<br/>- Shoot through umbrella up front and at camera right (about 45 degrees). Being relatively huge compared to the "model" it wraps Mrs/ Snuggles with a nice soft light.<br/>- The wall and the bright furniture on camera left act as a reflector giving a nice fill on that side<br/>- There is also another light with a gridded snoot, aimed at the bacjground, right behind the subject.<br/> <br/>Except for the text and the border, there is not much post processing. Only small adjustments (straighten, brightness, contrast, clarity).<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Jules1x: ahhh.  What a sweet bear.  Nicely lit.   Thank you. I was going for cute :-) The lighting was more or less classic portrait:- Shoot through umbrella up front and at camera right (about 45 degrees). Being relatively huge compared to the "model" it wraps Mrs/ Snuggles with a nice soft light.- The wall and the bright furniture on camera left act as a reflector giving a nice fill on that side- There is also another light with a gridded snoot, aimed at the bacjground, right behind the subject. Except for the text and the border, there is not much post processing. Only small adjustments (straighten, brightness, contrast, clarity).', '2014-06-11 04:03:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(7226759, 1115521, 127021, '<td valign="top">You are clearly more of a nirvana fan than I thought! Congrats, celebrate- but not so much you get an Aneurysm!</td>', 'You are clearly more of a nirvana fan than I thought! Congrats, celebrate- but not so much you get an Aneurysm!', '2014-06-11 04:50:25.000000', NULL, 0),
