(7226842, 1115521, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by gyaban:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Tiny:</b></div><hr/><i> Would not have had you down as a fan, but that is good. Congrats on the image and ribbon. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks Tiny. In fact I am not really a fan: it was fun to listen to it when I was younger, but to be honest, it is very rarely on my playlist nowadays. Still good memories! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I''d say the same for me. This is an incredible replica. When I first saw it I was sure it was yours - it''s SO perfect!<br/> <br/>And the photo notes, another gem ;)</td>', 'Originally posted by gyaban: Originally posted by Tiny: Would not have had you down as a fan, but that is good. Congrats on the image and ribbon.   Thanks Tiny. In fact I am not really a fan: it was fun to listen to it when I was younger, but to be honest, it is very rarely on my playlist nowadays. Still good memories!   I''d say the same for me. This is an incredible replica. When I first saw it I was sure it was yours - it''s SO perfect! And the photo notes, another gem ;)', '2014-06-11 08:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
